      "id": "k1",
      "prompt": "Start with an empty list. Ask Word? again and again. When the answer is stop, end the loop. Otherwise add the word to the end of the list. Then print how many words there are and the list. With sun, sea and stop:\nWord? sun\nWord? sea\nWord? stop\n2 words: ['sun', 'sea']",
      "solution": [
        "words = []",
        "while True:",
        "    word = input(\"Word? \")",
        "    if word == \"stop\":",
        "        break",
        "    words.append(word)",
        "print(f\"{len(words)} words: {words}\")"
      ],
